.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou can also set it so it only plays when you die at <cy>55%</c>  \r\n\r\n**ENJOY!!**\r\n\r\n\r\n# <cg>VORTROX MODE</c>\r\n<cg>Vortrox Mode</c> is a new setting introduced in update <cy>1.2.0</c>\r\n\r\n\r\nYou can turn on <cg>Vortrox Mode</c> from the setting to enable <cp>something special</c> upon death at <cb>92%</c>\r\n\r\n## Bug reports\r\nDM me on discord (<c-00ff4c>@D</c><c-19ff5e>o</c><c-32ff6f>m</c><c-4bff81>i</c><c-64ff93>n</c><c-7dffa6>o</c><c-97ffba>K</c><c-b0ffcd>i</c><c-9effb1>d</c><c-77ff7f>d</c><c-50ff4c>o</c><c-29ff1a>o</c>)\r\n\r\n## Another note\r\nIf Kingsammelot sees this and decides to make a video/short/post (or anything), please tag me (again, <c-00ff4c>@D</c><c-19ff5e>o</c><c-32ff6f>m</c><c-4bff81>i</c><c-64ff93>n</c><c-7dffa6>o</c><c-97ffba>K</c><c-b0ffcd>i</c><c-9effb1>d</c><c-77ff7f>d</c><c-50ff4c>o</c><c-29ff1a>o</c> on yt.)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","changelog":"# 1.2.1\r\n- Fixed minor typos that were annoying me\r\n\r\n\r\n# 1.2.0\r\n- Added vortrox 92 as an optional setting\r\n- Made mobile resume button only trigger after anti-unpause cooldown\r\n- Added option to disable mobile button\r\n\r\n# 1.1.2\r\n- Fixed bug where animation would trigger on noclip death\r\n\r\n# 1.1.1\r\n- Added option for fullscreen\r\n- Added button to resume level for mobile!\r\n\r\n# 1.1.0\r\n- Fixed bug where the video would continuously play\r\n\r\n# 1.0.91\r\n- Fixed bug where you would get noclip\r\n\r\n# 1.0.9\r\n- Fixed bug with show trajectory\r\n\r\n# 1.0.8\r\n- Fixed practice mode bug\r\n\r\n# 1.0.7\r\n- Fixed video when unfocusing game\r\n- Added volume slider\r\n\r\n# 1.0.6\r\n- Fixed bug with startpos switcher\r\n\r\n# 1.0.5\r\n- Made sure video is visible even if you hide pause menu (in a mod menu like eclipse, qolmod ect)\r\n\r\n\r\n# 1.0.4\r\n- Ensured logic is skipped in platformer\r\n\r\n# 1.0.3\r\n- Added one second cooldown before unpausing when animation starts\r\n\r\n\r\n# 1.0.2\r\n- Fixed channel-related crash\r\n\r\n\r\n# 1.0.1\r\n- Migrated video/audio to pauselayer, and made it so you can still exit/resume level.\r\n\r\n\r\n# 1.0.0\r\n- Initial release\r\n","created_at":"2026-05-21T21:29:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T11:10:34Z","links":{"community":null,"homepage":null,"source":"https://github.com/DominoKiddoo/fivefive-gdmod"}}